      "before": "kpk1-l13-c4-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Nie miałam zasięgu"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Zasięg* is a phone signal: *w górach nie miałam zasięgu*. To a friend who went quiet: *nie odbierałeś telefonu!* (you didn't answer the phone!), *nie odpisywałaś!* (you didn't write back!). After *nie*, *telefon* becomes *telefonu* and *zasięg* becomes *zasięgu*. *Martwiliśmy się* is we were worried, and *nareszcie!* is at last!"
      }
    }
  ],
